    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathstreak is a first-person melee action game where everyone dies in one hit. Reach your goal by overcoming enemies. Try to understand the cause and background of events. Once you reach the top of the tower, your mission will be completed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies with Melee weapons!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/79ef2182b39f261b705e839298d719b5.poster.avif?t=1747217625\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/79ef2182b39f261b705e839298d719b5.webm?t=1747217625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/79ef2182b39f261b705e839298d719b5.mp4?t=1747217625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/ac628ba148d87a9cf6e2e17f3d3b4239.poster.avif?t=1747217625\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/ac628ba148d87a9cf6e2e17f3d3b4239.webm?t=1747217625\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/ac628ba148d87a9cf6e2e17f3d3b4239.mp4?t=1747217625\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies with Blades attached to your arms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2355960/extras/80096e4a98412d9d97d0c70e72194454.poster.avif?t=1747217625\" ><s